abstract: >-
  Resolutive Science v0.1.0 freezes the first public scientific package,
  including the RSMS mathematical and methodological foundation and the RCMS
  cosmology research line through completed Protocol 03. The release preserves
  reproducible validation records, data provenance, negative and inconclusive
  results, and explicit scientific-status boundaries. Candidate observational
  behavior reported by RCMS is not presented as a discovery or as validation
  of Resolutive Physics.
